results.json
session-outcome-*.txt
session-outcome-E*.json
session-summary-E*.txt
synthetic_harness_output.json
test_preflight_adapter*.py
think_free_test.py
viewcount_crates.py
collected_packages.jsonl

# Raw data directory at root (experiment outputs).
# Anchored: an unanchored `raw/` here is re-ignored by every later match and
# silently defeats the negations above, so EXPERIMENTS/*/raw/*.jsonl stops
# being trackable while protocols still promise an auditable capture.
# Fixed 2026-10-18 (E181).
/raw/
